// Title: HackTool - CrackMapExec Execution
// Rule ID: 42a993dd-bb3e-48c8-b372-4d6684c4106c
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.credential-access, attack.discovery, attack.t1047, attack.t1053, attack.t1059.003, attack.t1059.001, attack.t1110, attack.t1201
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_hktl_crackmapexec_execution.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
